    rdfs:label "HES Layer"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "HES Layer"@en ;
    skos:definition "One of the ten layers of the Human Experience System (somatic, predictive, affective, neural, memory, relational, ecological, generational, technological, temporal)."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "HES layers are placed in the clinical extension because they require the HES theoretical model."@en .

# RiskMechanism -> CXSO_0000183  [clinical]
