    rdfs:subClassOf cxso:CXSO_0000001 ;
    rdfs:label "Risk Mechanism"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Risk Mechanism"@en ;
    skos:definition "A mechanism of suicide risk, following HEF Chapter 25. The ontology names the mechanisms and defines no thresholds or scores, which remain clinical and implementation decisions."@en .

# TerritoryStatus -> CXSO_0000184  [clinical]
